+		/*
+		 * lilac 10.148: msm8998's Android 9 SDM sends rotation=0 to
+		 * mean "no rotation". The ABI spells that DRM_MODE_ROTATE_0
+		 * (== 1) and wants exactly one rotate bit, so is_power_of_2(0)
